      "target": "운전기사가 버스를 안전하게 몰아요.",
      "reading": "unjeongisaga beoseureul anjeonhage moryeoyo.",
      "translations": {
        "en": "The driver drives the bus safely.",
        "ko": "운전기사가 버스를 안전하게 몰아요.",
        "ipa": "unjeongisaga beoseureul anjeonhage moryeoyo.",
